  "bookId": "JOS",
  "reference": "Yoshuwa 13",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOS 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida miyeeng'waay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niwaasiit Yoshuwa nea niba gweanyeeka saang'a; ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha niny, “Ang'iing'i niwaasiidi ak gibeahi gweanyeeka saang'a, ak ea gudaasaang'a ng'eanyoojiga miyeegeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh ng'eanyoojiga siipuut gil: darooraka sean bea fuga Filisti ea dea fuga Geshuri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(ghang'eada Shihori, mida gayeewda Misri, ea ghwahita wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea ghwahita moonghooda Ekroni, sirarsa fuga Ganaani; gwanda sugoodi muut ambal fuga Filisti, ea Gasa gil, ea Ashdodi, ea Ashkeloni, ea Gati, ea Ekroni), ea giika bea fuga Afimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ea ng'eanyiisean bea fuga Ganaani, ea Meareeda fuga Sidoni, ea ghwahita Afeki, ea ghwahita moonghooda fuga Amori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ng'eanyiida fuga Gebali, ea Lebanoneeda sean, sigal heeda ghayeawa, ghang'eada Baal-gadi mida geeshta Giijeeda Hermoni ea gawa ghuuta ng'eanyiida Hamati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea fuga sean mida ng'eanyiida heayeeniga ghang'eada Lebanoni ea ghwahita Misrefot-maimu, eara fuga sean bea Sidoni. Gaydahoan saawa goosiipteawa madeeda fuga Israeli; ak giidawi fuga Israeli ng'eanyiida gwahearan, gawuurji gidaghayi earukuteaydi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi biissa lacha ng'eanyiini ak ginung' gwahearan eemooji shageash, ea fuga Manase silach bugusta.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lachooda ng'eanyiida Yordani duukusa heeda ghayeawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sea fuga mwaatkwa bea eemeeda Manase silach bugusta, ea fuga Rubeni ea gea Gadi ghwanyas hearaniischooda nyaawa, adaw Musa saawa, bea giigheawda Yordani bea meatkweeda ghayeawa, gawuurji gida ghayi adawda Musaheeda was siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eada Aroya mida ghuuta moangoachiyda Arnoni, ea mujiineeda mida bugusta moangoachi, ea mooheeda Medeba ea ghwahita Diboni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea mujiinajeega sean bea Sihoni ea sugoocheanda Amori, ghayi ambal Heshboni, ea ghwahita moonghooda fuga Amori; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Gileyadi, ea ng'eanyiida fuga Geshuri ea fuga Maaka, ea giijeesean bea Hermoni ea Bashaneesean, ea ghwahita Saleka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea sugoocheanduumeesean bea Ogu mida Bashani, ghayi ambal aba Ashtaroti ea aba Edreyi (geaghus ninyeeda ghayi abit aba boosteanga fuga Refayimu); suh gea ghayi bwar Musa ak ghahoani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwasunu fuga Israeli miighahoan fuga Geshuri ghana fuga Maaka ak gwanda bugusta fuga Israeli ea ghoah ghamneawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eemeeda Lawi; mii ghoadaw Musa hearaniischooda; haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA fuga Israeli gichea gwahearani, gawuurji gidarukusiinda niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida siitaw eemeeda Rubeni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw Musa eemeeda Rubeni hearaniischooda ng'eanyiida aba giteena fugeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ng'eanyiida nyaawa ghang'eada Aroya, mida riiksiinda moangoachiyda Arnoni, ea mujiineeda mida jeeda moangoachi, ea mooheesean bea Medeba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sea Heshboni, ea mujiinajeega sean mida jeeda mooheeda; Diboni, ea Bamot-baali, ea Bet-baal-meoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Yahasi ea Gedemoti, ea Mefati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Giriyatayimu, ea Sibima, ea Seret-shahareeda mida uhuuda heayeeda moangoachi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea Bet-peori, ea rarang'eadayda Bisga, ea Bet-yeshimoti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suh mujiinajeegiga sean mida mooheedean, ea sugoocheanduumeesean bea Sihoni was sugoocheanda fuga Amori, ghayi ambal ng'eanyiida Heshboni, ghayi joar Musa sea fuga hees bea Midiyani, nea Efi gil ea Rekemu ea Suri ea Huri ea Reba, was sugoodiga Sihoni mida jeeda ng'eanyiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara Balaamu was orjeeda Beyori, was siida ruku ramooranga bwar fuga Israeli aba ng'uta aba jeeda fugiga ghayi sibwariin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea moonghooda fuga Rubeni ea eenda Yordani gil moonghooda nyaawa. Nih hearaniischooda fuga Rubeni gil aba giteena fuga nyaawa ea mujiinajeega nyaawa ea gharang'weaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida siitaw eemeeda Gadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw Musa eara eemeeda Gadi hearaniischooda, aba giteena fugeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida nyaawa Yasa gil ea mujiinajeega sean bea Gileyadi, ea ng'eanyiida fuga Amoni silach bugusta nibiyeenya, ea ghwahita Aroya mida gayeewda Raba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghang'eada Heshboni ea ghwahita Ramat-mispe ea Betonimu, ak ghang'eada Mahanaimu ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida Debiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea jeeda moangoachiyda Bet-haramu, ea Bet-nimra, ea Sukoti, ea Safoni, ea ng'eanyiida lagaan bea sugoocheanduumeeda Sihoni ea sugoocheanda Heshboni, nea ghwanung' ghoah eenda Yordani moonghooda, ea ghwahita giigheawda Yordani bea heeda ghayeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih hearaniischooda fuga Gadi gil aba giteena fugeaba gheanyi. Sea mujiinajeega nyaawa ea gharang'weaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida siitaw Manase bea heeda ghayeawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
