              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Musa ea miighoadaw eemeeda Lawi hearaniischooda, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Israeli hearaniischooda nyaawa, gawuurji gidarukusiinda saawa.",
          "type": "text",
